sentences.text:
"a) This Hon'ble Court may be pleased to direct the Ld. Civil Court Senior Division Panvel to immediately release the amount of Rs.1,50,00,000/- (Rupees One Crore Fifty Lakhs only) to the Petitioners on ad-hoc basis pending the main execution application bearing Special Darkhast No.77 of 2022 before it, strictly on the medical condition of the wife of the Petitioner No.2;
b) That this Hon'ble Court may be pleased to direct the Ld. Civil Court Senior Division, Panvel to OCTOBER 16, 2023 Sneha Chavan 6 wp 10486-23.doc expedite the proceedings under Special Darkhast No.77 of 2022 pending before it;
c) Interim and ad-interim reliefs in the nature of prayer clauses (a) and (b);
d) Any other order in the interest of justice may be passed.

